From 3a5124e9c9aee503982da8c49081de7c4f0b6fae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:57:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: leds: Describe first-generation Qualcomm torch
 LEDs

Route the first-generation PM8226/PM8941 torch binding through the
existing attributed LED owner. Preserve the LTS maintainer roster; the
newer PAS service from the original parent is not needed for this entry.

Codex prepared this local reconciliation and verification. Original
authors, dates, source notices and scoped attribution are retained.
Human review and DCO remain pending; no sign-off certification, phone
action, publication or maintainer contact is claimed.

Backported from commit 8700b1c2b168 ("dt-bindings: leds: Describe
first-generation Qualcomm torch LEDs")
---
 MAINTAINERS | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index 9fdc86dd82c85..bc05a80940b95 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -21291,6 +21291,12 @@ F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/*qcom*
 F:	drivers/media/platform/qcom
 F:	include/dt-bindings/media/*qcom*
 
+QUALCOMM PM8941 TORCH LED DRIVER
+M:	Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
+L:	linux-leds@vger.kernel.org
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/qcom,pm8941-flash-led.yaml
+
 QUALCOMM SMB CHARGER DRIVER
 M:	Casey Connolly <casey.connolly@linaro.org>
 L:	linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org
-- 
